+# Typesense RAG Integration Examples
+
+This directory contains example configurations and usage patterns for integrating the Typesense RAG tool with the Drupal AI module.
+
+## Basic AI Agent Configuration
+
+Example configuration for an AI agent that can use Typesense RAG:
+
+```yaml
+# In a custom module's config/install directory
+ai.ai_provider.example_rag_provider.yml:
